			"notes": "- Added REI compatibility (fixes gh-1)\n- Fixed gh-5 (Sprinting stops when sprint key is released)\n  - You now continue sprinting after releasing the sprint key\n  - You can now double tap forward to sprint\n  - It works the same as normal sprinting now\n- Fixed gh-6 (1.16 version uses default mixin file name)\n- Starting in this version, the mod no longer bundles Cloth Config, it must be installed separately now.\n  - Bundled versions tend to bulk up modpacks by a noticeable amount. Notice these releases are only a fraction the file size as previous ones.\n  - See https://github.com/PieKing1215/DripSounds-Fabric/issues/3#issue-947136373"
		},
